      "cooked": "<p>I will be having a villain fight my players that has Power Dampening Field and Brainwashing Aura upgrades. I will probably make and print out altered character sheets for my players based on what penalties they have.<br>\nThe villain is an Enlightened Madness Kung Fu Clown reality warper- “The world is just a joke, and we are the punchline” since he thinks nothing is real or serious he makes the world around him less real and less serious. what type of “turned into a cartoon” shenanigans might best represent loss power &amp; loss quality, only loss power, only loss quality?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2026-08-08T04:20:51.154Z",
